{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>九龍灣有人暈倒不治。今日（28日）下午1時28分，彩盛里彩興苑一名男住戶懷疑於單位內暈倒，其家人發現後報案求助。</p><p>救護員接報到場，經檢查後，證實姓劉（52歲）事主當場死亡。警方將案件列「屍體發現」，稍後將驗屍確定其死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"九龍灣彩興苑一名男住戶暈倒家中，當場不治。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220815/635982049471107072691738.jpeg/4zTWDhniO64unW9EgBePGx8E-FZCfYvYUNccW1DXHFs\"/><figcaption>九龍灣彩興苑一名男住戶暈倒家中，當場不治。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:01:11.005211+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:45:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:42.796669+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:58:34.370077+00:00","content_hash":"32c816c24456d8e50e3bfdfeecf0b23a087700d5a777c0ad19a4363396b5f8ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}